t of the relationship rather than the end of the work. The verified grower who completes this loop once has the habit that fills a season with orders, and the habit that fills a season is the habit that fills the farm for years.\n\nThe gap between the verified grower and the selling grower is only these four steps, and the steps are only habits. Do them once and you learn them; do them a season and you own them. The first sale is the hardest because every step is new, and the tenth is the easiest because every step is familiar, so make the first one count by doing each step deliberately rather than quickly. Keep the proof current, keep the listing honest, answer every contact within the day, and deliver exactly what you quoted. The grower who does these four things every week does not need luck, because the habit is the strategy, and the strategy that is kept is what fills the farm for the whole season and for the season after that.",
